OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny rain
OL,6,Fwill soon clear northeastwards in the
OL,7,Fevening, then rather cloudy with a few
OL,8,Fshowers. Drier and clearer conditions
OL,9,Freturning from the west overnight.
OL,10,FBreezy around the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMainly dry and bright in the
OL,13,Fmorning. Cloud increasing with rain
OL,14,Fspreading east during the afternoon,
OL,15,Fthe rain turning heavy at times.
OL,16,FBecoming drier again later in the
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
