OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith bright spells and showers on
OL,7,FFriday. Lighter winds, bright spells
OL,8,Fand the odd shower Saturday morning,
OL,9,Fsome rain in the afternoon. Strong
OL,10,Fwinds, heavy rain expected on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
